{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109130243227-1109_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261109130243\"/><p>懷特（左）是特朗普（右）的盟友。</p><p>美國總統特朗普上周六（7日）發文指已邀請UFC終極格鬥大賽主席懷特出任白宮發言人，他周日（8日）改口稱自己只是開玩笑。</p><p>特朗普在佛羅里達州見記者時被問及此事，他稱只是開玩笑，但這是一個例子，然後人們說這實際上是個相當不錯的主意。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.358198+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T05:02:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:27.327999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:37.313153+00:00","content_hash":"ae016ae27f4e62a0a651466b8781487d9ae907b339182dbd4b941bf479889dff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}